  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{目|め}→目：00525_me⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{逸|そ}らす: to avert one's eyes\n- ⟦{視線|しせん}→視線：14138_shisen⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{逸|そ}らす: to look away\n- ⟦{話題|わだい}→話題：03793_wadai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{逸|そ}らす: to change the subject\n- ⟦{注意|ちゅうい}→注意：01464_chuui⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{逸|そ}らす: to divert attention\n\nUSAGE: Always takes an object (what is being turned away). The most common pattern is ⟦{目|め}→目：00525_me⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{逸|そ}らす. Can imply avoidance or discomfort.",
